+/*
+ * We used to push/pull timeval and timespec
+ * with NDR_SCALARS and a 2nd time with
+ * NDR_BUFFERS. This is wrong as it's a
+ * scalar type and the 2nd call with NDR_BUFFERS
+ * should do nothing.
