+/*
+ * FreeBSD has no statmount(2)/listmount(2) and no 64-bit unique mount
+ * IDs. Here a mount ID is the device ID of the mount root: every FreeBSD
+ * mount -- each mounted ZFS dataset included -- has a distinct st_dev,
+ * and every file's st_dev equals its mount's, which is what lets
